{"sourceUrl":"https://ees.hit.edu.cn/2026/0918/c15565a401748/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:51.962005+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://ees.hit.edu.cn/2026/0918/c15565a401748/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span>诚挚欢迎全国各高校的优秀应届本科毕业生通过推荐免试方式来我院攻读硕士学位研究生。为便于推免生申请，具体安排如下：</span></p><p><span><span>1.</span><span>基本修业年限</span></span></p><p><span><span>我院硕士研究生基本修业年限3</span><span>年。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span><span>申请条件</span></span></p><p><span>须满足我校接收推免生的相关要求。</span></p><p><span>https://yzb.hit.edu.cn/2026/0912/c22276a401455/page.htm</span></p><p><span><span>3.</span><span>申请流程</span></span></p><p><span><span>根据学校统一工作安排，有意申报我院2027</span><span>年推免生预选拔的校内外具备推免资格的学生，须登录哈工大研招办官网（</span><span>http://yzb.hit.edu.cn</span><span>），通过学校</span><span>“</span><span>推免生信息采集系统</span><span>”</span><span>完成预报名。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（1</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>报名时间：截止到2026</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>20</span><span>日上午9点。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（2</span><span>）</span></span><span>审核时间：申请人在完成信息采集后，学院将集中进行审核。</span></p><p><span><span>（3</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>通知形式：学院将通过</span><span>“</span><span>推免生信息采集系统</span><span>”</span><span>或邮件等渠道，分批次通知学生审核结果和考核安排。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.</span><span>考核安排</span></span></p><p><span>考核时间与方式另行通知。</span></p><p><span><span>5.</span><span>其他</span></span></p><p><span><span>（1</span><span>）所有考生（包括本校应届本科毕业生）均须通过</span><span>“</span><span>推免生信息采集系统</span><span>”</span><span>进行报名，学院接收计划完成后，将不再接收未在系统中报名的考生。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（2</span><span>）全国推免服务系统开通后，将根据接收计划、报名情况等依照考核结果从高到低顺序确定录取名单。取得所在学校推免生资格且报考我院的上述校内外推免生，在规定时间内，登录全国推免服务系统完成网上录取确认。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（3</span><span>）招生专业详见附件一。</span></span></p><p><span>6</span><span><span>.</span><span>联系方式</span></span></p><p><span>联系人：王老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：0451-86402619</span></p><p><span>邮箱：</span><span>wanghecheng@hit.edu.cn</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>其他未尽事宜由哈尔滨工业大学未来工学院负责解释。</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span>哈尔滨工业大学未来工学院</span></p><p><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>18</span><span>日</span></p><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ees.hit.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_pdf.gif\"/><a href=\"https://ees.hit.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/d5/ff/8da961894fbbb182ca0c39f967c9/dd2ad8ce-99d6-4d3b-8a66-88b9521713d7.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件一 招生专业详情.pdf</a></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"8c85dde9a2b4f32368ff3885bbb3a47e3e5d78bb0a7605ac19a26fd216c4a2ed","textLength":680,"sourceSha256":"e8cab66d5d521ad87220647390ead13a2a6bee175a01909d1b24395b2dcbd528","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-aa3f08481b97e6a68de4","title":"2026年哈尔滨工业大学未来工学院2027年接收优秀应届本科毕业生攻读硕士研究生报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:51.962005+00:00"}
